+{"milestone": "M5_context_change", "step": 240, "tool": "command_execution", "tool_output": "---\r\nname: data-harness\r\ndescription: Use for implementing the mini data processing harness fixture.\r\n---\r\n\r\n# Data Harness Skill\r\n\r\n蹇呴』閬靛畧锛?\r\n- 绂佹 `pip install` 鎴栦緷璧栨湭澹版槑绗笁鏂瑰寘锛汣LI 浼樺厛鐢?argparse銆?\r\n- 杈撳叆鏀寔 CSV 鍜?JSONL銆?\r\n- 娓呮礂瑙勫垯锛氬幓闄ょ┖琛岋紱瀛楁鍚嶈浆 snake_case锛涚己灏?`id` 鐨勮褰曡繘鍏?rejects銆?\r\n- DAG 浠诲姟蹇呴』鏈?`extract`銆乣clean`銆乣report` 涓変釜闃舵銆?\r\n- 澶辫触閲嶈瘯鏈€澶?2 娆★紱鏃ュ織蹇呴』鍖呭惈 `attempt`銆乣stage`銆乣status`銆?\r\n- 鎶ュ憡蹇呴』鍖呭惈 `processed_count`銆乣rejected_count`銆乣retry_count`銆乣source_files`銆?\r\n- 鍖呭繀椤绘敮鎸?`python -m mini_harness run data/input.csv data/events.jsonl --output tmp/report.json`銆?\r\n- `mini_harness.runner` 蹇呴』瀵煎嚭 `run_dag` 鍜?`HarnessError`銆?\r\n- 鏈€缁堝鐩樻姤鍛婂繀椤诲紩鐢?`memory/memory_summary.md`銆?\r\n", "tool_error": false, "event_type": "tool_result", "event_id": "item_122"}
